Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Codec 11300/11301 theo dinh dang that cua engine (zca-js)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

zca-js ZRTPPacketCodec.ts:279 DEFAULT_ZALO_AUDIO_CODEC la chuoi
JSON list, khong phai chu tran 'opus':
'[{"dynamicFptime":0,"frmPtime":20,"name":"opus/16000/1","payload":112}]'

- media_endpoints.DEFAULT_ZALO_AUDIO_CODEC (hang so moi, export).
- 11300 gui dung chuoi list (server.py buoc 1, khi UI khong gui
  codec); 11301 gui chuoi list (for_call default moi).
- applyServerInfo: response 11300 tra ve codec khac '[]' thi dung
  codec do cho 11301 (ZaloRtcSession.ts:4505-4506).
- g711 KHONG con quyet dinh codec signaling (mo ta codec media,
  khong phai chuoi codec trong 11301; zca-js khong doc g711).
- vc_requestcall docstring cap nhat: dinh dang that da biet.
- Test do-truoc-xanh-sau: tests/test_codec_zca_js.py 9 test
  (1/9 do -> 9/9 xanh); mock ghi codec tren day ca hai buoc;
  cap nhat 3 assertion test_media_provider + 2 assertion
  test_call_diag_11301 theo hanh vi moi.
- Full suite: ALL TEST SUITES PASSED (48 muc, ke ca test moi).

Nguon: bao cao outbox/zca-js-tong-hop.md §4.4/§7.2; repo
softtyos/zca-js v2.3.13. Chua push — cho user duyet + deploy +
test live goi Dai ca.
