 11303
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Nguon: bao cao outbox/zca-js-tong-hop.md §7.4; code zca-js v2.3.13
(control.handler.ts, ZaloRtcSession.ts acceptIncomingCall ~2110,
rejectIncomingCall ~2250, parseIncomingCallEvent ~582,
answerVoiceCall.ts / ringRingVoiceCall.ts / cancelVoiceCall.ts /
endVoiceCall.ts).

- ctrl_poll.extract_call_events: tach call_event tu kenh ctrl 99101
  (act_type 'voip'; callId/caller/session/codec/rtp/rtcp/callType
  tu data/params/extendData long nhau, dict hoac chuoi JSON);
  CtrlPoller dispatch qua on_call_event (loi callback khong chet
  poller), last_batch them 'call_events'.
- CallLog: trang thai live moi 'incoming' + record_incoming
  (thay the cuoc live truoc); record_answered mo cho
  'incoming' -> 'answered'; snapshot/record_end nhan 'incoming'.
- server._on_ctrl_call_event: 'request' -> entry incoming +
  ringring 11302 best-effort (daemon thread) + webhook
  call.incoming; 'cancel'/'end' cho incoming -> ended 'missed'
  (cuoc goi nho) + webhook call.ended; 'answer' cho goi di ->
  _mark_answered nguon 'sync' (gui answerack 11304 — phia caller).
  Khong arm ring timer cho incoming.
- POST /api/call/answer: tra loi cuoc incoming — 11300 fallback
  (cung callId, partner = caller) + for_call + 11303 answer voi
  codec list JSON; KHONG gui 11301 (tin hieu caller) va KHONG gui
  11304 answerack (tin hieu caller); _mark_answered(..., send_ack=False).
- POST /api/call/reject: tu choi cuoc incoming — cancel (11305)
  + endcall (11306), ca hai best-effort, local-first, detail
  'user_rejected' (theo zca-js rejectIncomingCall, khong chi 11306
  nhu bao cao §7.4 ghi).
- Mock: nhanh ringring (11302) + answer (11303, KHONG co imei —
  fallthrough chung se loai sai neu khong co nhanh rieng); ghi
  answer_codec/answer_addresses; 'answer' dua server_state ve
  connected nhu answerack.
- Test do-truoc-xanh-sau: tests/test_call_incoming_zca.py 12 test
  (extractor, poller, CallLog, server callback, answer/reject e2e).
- Dinh chinh theo code: 11304 la tin hieu CALLER, callee khong gui
  (bao cao §7.4 buoc 4 chua dung).
- Full suite: ALL TEST SUITES PASSED (49 muc).

Chua push — cho user duyet + deploy + test live (goi den tu tai
khoan phu khac + goi di goi Dai ca voi codec moi). Bong bong cuoc
goi nho hien chu 'sendBubbleMessage': CHUA sua — chuoi do den tu
server duoi dang noi dung tin nhan, chua co hinh dang that cua
message do de sua dung (can payload sync cua mot cuoc goi nho that).
